因为\(x\)是正的纯小数，所以\(0&lt;x&lt;1\)，从而\(\frac{1}{x}-x&gt;0\). 因此\[\sqrt{x^2-2+\frac{1}{x^2}}=\sqrt{\left(\frac{1}{x}-x\right)^2}=\frac{1}{x}-x\]又\[1-\frac{x^2}{1+x^2}=\frac{1}{1+x^2}\]所以\[\frac{2x^{-2}}{1-\frac{x^2}{1+x^2}}=\frac{2x^{-2}}{\frac{1}{1+x^2}}=\frac{2\left(1+x^2\right)}{x^2}\]于是原式\[=\left(\frac{1}{x}-x\right)\left(x+\frac{1}{x}\right)\div\frac{2\left(1+x^2\right)}{x^2}
=\frac{1-x^2}{x}\cdot\frac{1+x^2}{x}\cdot\frac{x^2}{2\left(1+x^2\right)}
=\frac{1-x^2}{2}\]

